      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦～不要讲这种像老师会讲的话！\n要说“你回来啦，摩耶重炮（心）”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5728fdfb0059cf36f320f802baa1e16cdfa137c93e611f77267ff269df0ff9d3",
